1      0  1  0  0
2      1  1  0  0
3      0  0  1  0
4      1  0  1  0
5      0  0  0  1
6      1  0  0  1
> lm.series(data, design)

Does this make sense? Does it make sense given the mess with the variable 
number of replicates within arrays (question 1)?


